       The  ffoorrmm  library maintains a default value for field attributes.  You
       can get or set this default by calling  the  appropriate  sseett__  or  re‐
       trieval  routine with a NNUULLLL field pointer.  Changing this default with
       a sseett__ function affects future field creations, but does not change the
       rendering of fields already created.

