       These  routines emulate the System V forms library.  They were not sup‐
       ported on Version 7 or BSD versions.

       A form facility was documented in  SVr4.2's  _C_h_a_r_a_c_t_e_r  _U_s_e_r  _I_n_t_e_r_f_a_c_e
       _P_r_o_g_r_a_m_m_i_n_g document.

       It is not part of X/Open Curses.

       Aside from _n_c_u_r_s_e_s, there are few implementations:

       •   systems based on SVr4 source code, e.g., Solaris.

       •   NetBSD curses.

       A  few  functions  in  this  implementation  are  extensions  added for
       _n_c_u_r_s_e_s,   but   not   provided   by   other   implementations,   e.g.,
       ffoorrmm__ddrriivveerr__ww, uunnffooccuuss__ccuurrrreenntt__ffiieelldd.

